            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><!---<div style="border:solid 3px #990000; padding:5px; margin-bottom:10px; background-color:#990000; color:#FFFFFF;"><strong>District Court will be closed on Monday, December 24th and Tuesday, December 25th for the Christmas Holiday.</strong></div>--->
