                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>This brochure explains the process for asking the court for a free court interpreter in a case.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/courtforms/joint/ccdc081br.pdf/ccdc081br.pdf">CC-DC-081BR </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-title">Working Effectively with Interpreters in the Courtroom                 </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2016-09-21T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">09/2016</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body">                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/courtforms/joint/ccdc084.pdf/ccdc084.pdf">CC-DC-084 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-title">Notice of Appearance                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-07-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">07/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span>Use this form if you are an attorney entering your appearance to represent the defendant/plaintiff/other party in a court case.</span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/courtforms/joint/ccdc088.pdf/ccdc088.pdf">CC-DC-088 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-title">Attorney&#039;s Statement in Support of Waiver of Costs                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2025-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2025</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">1                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span>Use this form if you are an attorney retained through: Maryland Legal Aid, the Office of the Public Defender, or a pro-bono or legal services program representing an individual and want to request the waiver of costs without the need for a court order.</span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccdc089.pdf">CC-DC-089 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-title">Request for Waiver of Costs                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2025-11-14T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">11/2025</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span>Use this form if you are unable to pay the court filing fees and want to ask the court to waive fees at the beginning of the case.&nbsp;</span></p><p><img src="/sites/default/files/import/district/guideandfilelogo2.png" alt="Guide &amp; File logo" width="160" height="55" loading="lazy"></p><p>Need help filling out court forms? Maryland Guide &amp; File is a web-based tool that helps fill out court forms. To use this Maryland Guide &amp; File interview, <a href="https://maryland.tylertech.cloud/SRL/SRL/Start?legalProcessKey=CCDC089">CLICK HERE</a>.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/courtforms/joint/ccdc090.pdf/ccdc090.pdf">CC-DC-090 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-title">Request for Final Waiver of Open Costs                 </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-07-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">07/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span>Use this form if the court has ordered you to pay some or all of the costs at the end of your case and you cannot afford to pay. </span><a href="/legalhelp/filingfeewaivers"><span>Learn more</span></a><span>.</span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/courtforms/joint/ccdc091.pdf/ccdc091.pdf">CC-DC-091 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-title">Request for Waiver of Costs for Assembling the Record for an Appeal                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-07-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">07/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span>Use this form if you are unable to pay the costs associated with assembling the record for an appeal to request a waiver. You must also submit the CC-DC-092 – Request for Waiver of Appellate Costs. </span><a href="/legalhelp/filingfeewaivers"><span>Learn more</span></a><span>.&nbsp;Note: The forms permit you <strong>to request a waiver of the costs of preparing the transcript</strong>, an essential part of the appeal process, <strong>in the District Court only</strong>. If your original case was heard in Circuit Court, the court cannot waive the transcript costs. You will need to pay for the costs of preparing the transcripts in those cases yourself, in order for your case to proceed.</span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccdc092.pdf">CC-DC-092 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-title">Request for Waiver of Appellate Costs                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-07-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">07/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span><span><span>Use this form if you cannot afford to pay the costs of filing an appeal and you want to request that these costs be waived.</span></span></span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
