                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span><span><span>Use this form to give notice to a party of a case who is receiving health care (patient) that their medical records have been subpoenaed in reference to a District Court case pursuant to § 4-306 of the Health-General Article.</span></span></span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
