                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--2" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span>Use this form to apply for a Public Defender to represent you in a criminal or traffic case that carries a penalty of incarceration, and you cannot afford an attorney.</span><img></p><p><img src="/sites/default/files/import/district/guideandfilelogo2.png" alt="Guide &amp; File logo" width="160" height="55" loading="lazy"></p><p>Need help filling out court forms? Maryland Guide &amp; File is a web-based tool that helps fill out court forms. To use this Maryland Guide &amp; File interview, <a href="https://maryland.tylertech.cloud/SRL/SRL/Start?legalProcessKey=DC099">CLICK HERE</a>.</p>                </td>
