<table class="cols-5 sticky-enabled">
            <h3> Forms categorized as:&nbsp;<strong>
                                    Peace Order
                            </strong>
                    </h3>
                <thead>
        <tr>
                                                                            <th id="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1" scope="col">Form Number</th>
                                                                            <th id="view-title-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-title" scope="col">Title</th>
                                                                            <th id="view-field-last-revised-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised" scope="col">Last Revised</th>
                                                                            <th id="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court" scope="col">Copies to Court</th>
                                                                            <th id="view-body-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-body" scope="col">Notes</th>
                    </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/courtforms/joint/ccdc077.pdf/ccdc077.pdf">CC-DC-077 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-title">General Waiver and Release - for use with shielding of domestic violence and peace order records                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2024-08-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">08/2024</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if requesting to shield domestic violence (CC-DC-DV-021 A or B) or peace order (CC-DC-PO-016 A or B) records and it is earlier than three (3) years after the denial or dismissal of the <span><span><span>petition or after the consent expires. This is a release of all the requesting party’s claims for damages relating to this proceeding and &nbsp;any and all tort claims that may arise out of this &nbsp;proceeding.</span></span></span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/courtforms/joint/ccdcdvpo001br.pdf/ccdcdvpo001br.pdf">CC-DC-DV-PO-001BR </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-title">Peace &amp; Protective Order Brochure                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-10T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Information on how to file for a peace or protective order. Learn more about <a href="/legalhelp/domesticviolence">Protective Orders</a> and <a href="/legalhelp/peaceorders">Peace Orders</a>.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccdcpo001a.pdf">CC-DC-PO-001A </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-title">Addendum to Peace Order Petition                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2024-01-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">01/2024</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-copies-to-court-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-field-copies-to-court">                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--3" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to provide law enforcement with a description of a respondent for service of process. <a href="/legalhelp/peaceorders">Learn more</a>.</p>                </td>
