                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--5" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span><span><span>This form lists the charges and timeframes to be eligible to expunge nuisance crimes (drinking alcohol or sleeping in public, panhandling, loitering, or using transit without payment, for example) under Criminal Procedural Article § 10-105.</span></span></span></p>                </td>
