                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--11" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Form used to state compliance with the <a href="https://www.congress.gov/116/bills/hr748/BILLS-116hr748enr.pdf">Coronavirus Aid, Relief, and Economic Security Act (“CARES Act”)</a>. The CARES Act provides a <strong>temporary moratorium on eviction filings</strong>, as well as other protections for tenants in certain <strong>covered properties</strong>.</p>
                </td>
                    </tr>
